<title>JAPAN: Matsushita-Kotobuki, Quantum to set up venture.</title>
<headline>Matsushita-Kotobuki, Quantum to set up venture.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matsushita-Kotobuki Electronics Industries Ltd said on Thursday that it and Quantum Corp have agreed to set up a joint venture in the United States for making recording heads for hard disk drives.</p>
<p>The new firm, which will take over Quantum's recording head operation, will be 51 percent held by Matsushita-Kotobuki and the rest by Quantum, the Japanese firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>Matsushita-Kotobuki is a major producer of video players.</p>
<p>Quantum is a major manufacturer of hard disk drives in the United States.</p>
</text>
